	(text "Status pixel chain: GP20 -> U6 (3.3 V to 5 V) -> slot 1 -> ... -> slot 8. Last output unused.\nString data: 1=GP4, 2=GP5, 3=GP6, 4=GP2, 5=GP3, 6=GP11, 7=GP12, 8=GP13.\nFull 2 A load on eight strings is 16 A plus peripherals; main power interconnect is not yet sized." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 220.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "44939179-6584-4ee4-8128-b6bd424fc9a3"))
	(text "EIGHT SLOTS \\u2014 strings 1\\u20134 measured by U4; strings 5\\u20138 by U5.\n25 m\\u03a9 daughtercard shunts. Sense fingers are Kelvin signals, not load-current paths."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
